    <Section>Main</Section>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277392</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……ここらで少し休憩しないか</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...Why don't we stop and rest here?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277440</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>そうしようか</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Sounds good.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277520</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>それじゃあ、オレは
辺りをぶらぶらしようかな</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Then I guess I'll go for
a walk around town.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277588</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>わたしたちは、
買い物に行こうよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>We're going to
go shopping.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277668</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>それじゃあ、僕は
ちょっと剣の特訓でも
してるよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>In that case, I'll
train with my
sword for a bit.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277720</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>え……特訓……？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Eh? Training?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>6</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277788</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>おいおい、
休憩の意味なくないか？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Hey, you do know what
"rest" means, don't you?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>7</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277868</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>そうかもしれないけど、
なんか落ち着かなくてさ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Yeah, but I can't
seem to settle down.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>8</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277944</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Cless&gt;さん、
オレも一緒に……
いいかな？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Is it okay if I train
with you, &lt;Cless&gt;?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>9</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>278052</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>おい、&lt;Dio&gt;、
やめといたほうがいいぞ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Hey, &lt;Dio&gt;, you're better
off if you don't.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>10</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>278052</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>そいつの特訓は
ハンパじゃないからな</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>His training is intense.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>10</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>278128</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>そう、かな？
確かにそう易しくは
ないけどね</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Huh, is it? Well, it's not
all that easy, that's true.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>12</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>278244</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ふっふっふ！
オレだってここまで
旅を続けてきたんだぜ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Ha ha ha! As you
know, I've already
traveled all this way.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>13</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>278244</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>それなりに
強くなってるしな</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>And I've got plenty of
strength to show for it.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>13</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>278368</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>よし、それじゃあ、
特別に君に新しい技を
伝授するよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Alright, then, maybe I'll
pass on a new arte to
you while we train.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>15</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>278368</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>まずランニングだ。
ついてこられるかな！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>We'll start with running.
Try to keep up!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>15</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>278416</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>望むところだ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>You're on!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>17</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>278492</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>あ、おい、ちょっ……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Uh, hey, wai...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>18</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>278492</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……知らねぇぞ……？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...Don't say I didn't warn you...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>18</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
